  "body": "### Dependencies\n\n- **deps:** Bump the python-dependencies group with 3 updates ([#133](https://github.com/sauljabin/kaskade/pull/133)) ([a1510b7](https://github.com/sauljabin/kaskade/commit/a1510b7fb9f463137b646ecb9ece0cd802a13720))\n- **deps:** Bump the github-actions group with 3 updates ([#137](https://github.com/sauljabin/kaskade/pull/137)) ([2acc204](https://github.com/sauljabin/kaskade/commit/2acc204467a4ba7807f85a5f74495a12b28f28f6))\n- **deps:** Bump the python-dependencies group with 5 updates ([#138](https://github.com/sauljabin/kaskade/pull/138)) ([fc5494a](https://github.com/sauljabin/kaskade/commit/fc5494af74b62e677d1b0387936d118e04cd0c34))\n\n### Fixes\n\n- **sandbox:** Harden schema registry healthcheck ([#135](https://github.com/sauljabin/kaskade/pull/135)) ([e7e3622](https://github.com/sauljabin/kaskade/commit/e7e362238da4476e9c0728161289c2969650172a))\n- **auth:** Align apicurio oauth handling ([824ba6e](https://github.com/sauljabin/kaskade/commit/824ba6ef2eb545a022637b3653291c401ccdf427))\n\n### Documentation\n\n- **readme:** Restore platform badges ([#136](https://github.com/sauljabin/kaskade/pull/136)) ([4cf0e1f](https://github.com/sauljabin/kaskade/commit/4cf0e1f3b1541dd7b34d09dca659ddfee095f092))\n\n\n**Full Changelog:** [v5.0.0...v5.0.1](https://github.com/sauljabin/kaskade/compare/v5.0.0...v5.0.1)\n"
